<ul dir="auto">
<li>Update README for download-artifact v5 changes by <a href="https://github.com/yacaovsnc"><code class="notranslate">@​yacaovsnc</code></a> in <a href="https://redirect.github.com/actions/download-artifact/pull/417">actions/download-artifact#417</a></li>
