<li>Bump <code class="notranslate">@actions/artifact</code> to <code class="notranslate">v4.0.0</code></li>
<li>Prepare <code class="notranslate">v6.0.0</code> by <a href="https://github.com/danwkennedy"><code class="notranslate">@​danwkennedy</code></a> in <a href="https://redirect.github.com/actions/download-artifact/pull/438">actions/download-artifact#438</a></li>
</ul>
