<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Completed task" checked=""> Rewrites the <code class="notranslate">@supports font-format</code> example to fix the mistake.</li>
<li class="task-list-item"><input type="checkbox" id="" disabled="" class="task-list-item-checkbox" aria-label="Completed task" checked=""> Fixes the color font example URL to link to a font file, not CSS.</li>
